WEBVTT

00:31.606 --> 00:35.156
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.176 --> 00:38.556
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.826 --> 00:44.796
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.956 --> 00:49.586
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.606 --> 00:53.116
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.136 --> 00:56.626
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.646 --> 01:00.156
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.176 --> 01:06.236
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.496 --> 01:23.776
Si Jin

01:23.796 --> 01:27.776
Episode 12

01:27.776 --> 01:29.286
(Matchmaker Wang's Hall)

01:29.286 --> 01:30.516
Zhen,

01:30.536 --> 01:31.456
there's something

01:31.456 --> 01:32.816
I...

01:33.096 --> 01:34.976
I'd like to clarify.

01:35.096 --> 01:36.456
Go ahead.

01:36.896 --> 01:38.076
That day...

01:38.096 --> 01:39.496
Mr. Zhen.

01:43.296 --> 01:44.236
Mr. Zhen.

01:44.256 --> 01:45.596
Mr. Yu.

01:45.616 --> 01:46.516
Commandant Yu.

01:46.536 --> 01:47.896
Miss Si.

01:48.896 --> 01:50.976
What are you two doing?

01:56.296 --> 01:59.216
Having tea.

01:59.616 --> 02:00.676
Yes.

02:00.696 --> 02:03.296
I can see that.

02:04.176 --> 02:05.536
What a nice surprise.

02:06.296 --> 02:07.736
Miss Si,

02:08.056 --> 02:09.216
this year's new tea

02:09.216 --> 02:10.596
looks really nice.

02:10.616 --> 02:11.876
I've packed some

02:11.896 --> 02:13.436
for you to bring back.

02:13.456 --> 02:14.836
Thanks, Mrs. Zhen.

02:14.856 --> 02:17.116
Mother, this is

02:17.136 --> 02:19.096
Commandant Yu of Capital Security.

02:20.136 --> 02:21.616
Greetings, Mrs. Zhen.

02:21.896 --> 02:22.976
You really are

02:22.976 --> 02:25.756
a charming young man.

02:25.776 --> 02:27.316
That's very nice of you to say.

02:27.336 --> 02:28.716
You've had tea.

02:28.736 --> 02:30.836
It's boring to sit here and do nothing.

02:30.856 --> 02:32.896
The weather looks nice.

02:33.056 --> 02:34.456
Miss Si, Heng,

02:34.456 --> 02:37.296
let's go on an outing to the suburbs.

02:41.616 --> 02:43.276
I'm sorry

02:43.296 --> 02:44.996
to disappoint you.

02:45.016 --> 02:46.476
Mr. Zhen is needed

02:46.496 --> 02:48.776
at the Capital Security Office.

02:51.896 --> 02:53.576
I see.

02:53.736 --> 02:54.896
No wonder Commandant Yu

02:54.896 --> 02:56.616
came in a rush.

02:56.696 --> 02:57.756
Mother,

02:57.776 --> 02:59.396
I need to go to work.

02:59.416 --> 03:01.296
Sorry, I can't keep you company.

03:02.696 --> 03:05.156
My apologies, Miss Si.

03:05.176 --> 03:07.336
Please excuse me.

03:07.416 --> 03:08.776
Good day.

03:09.576 --> 03:11.496
Come on, Mr. Zhen.

03:11.776 --> 03:13.236
Let's go, Commandant Yu.

03:15.736 --> 03:17.576
Good day, Mrs. Zhen.

03:24.616 --> 03:26.736
That silly boy!

03:27.336 --> 03:28.296
My son only

03:28.296 --> 03:30.016
cares about his work.

04:04.576 --> 04:06.136
You look gorgeous, Pei.

04:10.016 --> 04:12.906
You're getting married, my dear.

04:12.926 --> 04:13.776
Don't you look forward

04:13.776 --> 04:15.246
to seeing me marry Administrator Lin?

04:15.246 --> 04:16.616
You should be happy.

04:16.976 --> 04:18.836
I am happy. I really am.

04:18.856 --> 04:21.056
She'll miss you when you're away.

04:21.776 --> 04:22.876
I made this handkerchief

04:22.896 --> 04:24.436
for your wedding.

04:24.456 --> 04:27.136
Here's some money for you.

04:28.336 --> 04:29.776
The clan has prepared a dowry for me.

04:29.776 --> 04:31.076
Keep the money to yourself.

04:31.096 --> 04:32.156
Once you leave,

04:32.176 --> 04:33.876
your life will be different.

04:33.896 --> 04:35.216
Money can bring you

04:35.216 --> 04:36.516
security.

04:36.536 --> 04:38.756
Don't be as self-willed as before.

04:38.776 --> 04:40.656
If you get hurt,

04:40.656 --> 04:42.376
do let me know.

04:45.176 --> 04:47.496
Once we marry,

04:47.656 --> 04:49.396
I'll be a good wife.

04:49.416 --> 04:51.136
Don't worry about me.

04:54.216 --> 04:57.996
"Cry the fish hawks on sandbars in the river.

04:58.016 --> 05:01.956
A mild-mannered good girl,
fine match for the gentleman.

05:01.976 --> 05:05.696
A ragged fringe is the floating-heart,
left and right we trail it."

05:06.096 --> 05:08.016
How dull and tedious!

05:08.416 --> 05:09.396
I'm tired of studying.

05:09.416 --> 05:11.516
Young Master, Miss Si said

05:11.536 --> 05:13.336
you had to copy this whole book today.

05:13.336 --> 05:16.016
No way. I can't.

05:18.216 --> 05:20.516
What are you doing, Master Qin?

05:20.536 --> 05:22.216
Does studying make you tired?

05:23.096 --> 05:24.716
- Come on.
- Can we hang out?

05:24.736 --> 05:25.756
Let's learn martial arts.

05:25.776 --> 05:26.956
No, I won't go!

05:26.976 --> 05:27.956
I can't!

05:27.976 --> 05:29.336
Come on!

05:33.736 --> 05:35.636
Ji, fetch the basin.

05:35.656 --> 05:36.756
No, no.

05:36.776 --> 05:38.136
I'm up.

05:45.436 --> 05:46.296
Too... too fierce.

05:46.296 --> 05:47.656
That's too much.

05:52.856 --> 05:54.156
Young Master!

05:54.176 --> 05:55.276
Young Master!

05:55.296 --> 05:56.656
Passed out already?

05:59.096 --> 05:59.936
Goodness!

05:59.946 --> 06:01.436
Stop beating that basin.

06:01.456 --> 06:03.316
You're making me deaf.

06:03.336 --> 06:04.436
It's still early.

06:04.456 --> 06:06.816
I can take a nap.

06:07.216 --> 06:08.696
Stop beating it!

06:09.916 --> 06:11.276
Come on!

06:12.296 --> 06:13.656
Come on!

06:14.076 --> 06:15.576
I quit.

06:16.396 --> 06:17.246
I'm exhausted.

06:17.256 --> 06:19.016
(Morning Drizzle)

06:19.016 --> 06:20.436
Young Master,

06:20.456 --> 06:21.536
before Master Qin left,

06:21.536 --> 06:23.156
he told Miss Si

06:23.176 --> 06:24.956
to have me watch you practice every day.

06:24.976 --> 06:26.576
I can't do it anymore,

06:26.976 --> 06:28.456
or I'll die.

06:32.416 --> 06:34.216
Who is this?

06:34.856 --> 06:35.856
It's only been days.

06:35.856 --> 06:38.136
What happened to you?

06:40.656 --> 06:42.136
What brings you here?

06:42.456 --> 06:43.756
To laugh at me?

06:43.776 --> 06:46.376
Don't give up, Jiang Zhan.

06:46.416 --> 06:47.856
Jiang Si asked me

06:47.856 --> 06:50.196
to teach you self-defense skills

06:50.216 --> 06:52.696
that Master Qin hadn't mentioned.

06:53.336 --> 06:54.696
Good heavens!

06:54.976 --> 06:58.016
Si is insane!

06:58.216 --> 06:59.576
Chuchu,

06:59.656 --> 07:01.516
do me a favor, will you?

07:01.536 --> 07:02.956
Knock me out.

07:02.976 --> 07:04.316
I can't do it anymore.

07:04.336 --> 07:06.396
Shut up and do as I say.

07:06.416 --> 07:08.196
Let's begin today's practice.

07:08.216 --> 07:09.396
Fine.

07:09.416 --> 07:11.066
Alright. Let's do it!

07:11.086 --> 07:11.926
What is it?

07:11.926 --> 07:14.336
I'll do whatever you say.

07:20.016 --> 07:21.376
This is

07:21.776 --> 07:23.376
what we're going to do.

07:25.096 --> 07:27.576
What do you mean?

07:28.096 --> 07:29.616
I know over the past few days,

07:29.616 --> 07:31.216
you've been exhausted.

07:31.216 --> 07:32.656
It takes time to learn

07:32.656 --> 07:33.956
martial arts.

07:33.976 --> 07:35.396
It can't be rushed,

07:35.416 --> 07:37.376
or it'll do more harm than good.

07:37.536 --> 07:39.196
To learn my skills,

07:39.216 --> 07:41.816
you need to recover your energy first.

07:42.096 --> 07:43.456
Miss Lu,

07:43.976 --> 07:44.896
I've never seen anyone

07:44.896 --> 07:46.516
as smart

07:46.536 --> 07:48.576
and kind as you!

07:48.896 --> 07:50.256
Save it.

07:50.336 --> 07:51.696
Eat up.

07:52.656 --> 07:55.056
It's so good to be outside.

07:55.536 --> 07:56.656
I could use some fresh air

07:56.656 --> 07:58.616
after being grounded for days.

07:58.976 --> 08:00.816
It was Jiang Si's fault.

08:01.096 --> 08:03.196
I'll make her pay someday.

08:03.216 --> 08:04.956
Ji, fetch a pot of liquor.

08:04.976 --> 08:06.336
Yes.

08:07.336 --> 08:08.596
- Eat with me.
- Who's that?

08:08.596 --> 08:09.456
No, thanks.

08:09.456 --> 08:10.816
Ms. Xiao,

08:10.856 --> 08:12.756
that's Miss Si's friend,

08:12.776 --> 08:14.376
Lu Chuchu.

08:14.456 --> 08:16.256
Lu Chuchu?

08:18.176 --> 08:20.376
Is that a girl?

08:20.536 --> 08:21.456
Why is she

08:21.456 --> 08:23.176
- dressed like that?
- Try it.

08:23.616 --> 08:24.616
Obviously,

08:24.616 --> 08:26.196
- she's not a decent girl,
- Eat it.

08:26.216 --> 08:28.536
but a humble civilian.

08:31.136 --> 08:32.656
Jiang Si

08:33.136 --> 08:34.956
planted her people

08:34.976 --> 08:35.936
in our mansion

08:35.936 --> 08:38.056
when I was grounded.

08:38.696 --> 08:40.056
Clearly,

08:40.856 --> 08:41.976
she's eager to

08:41.976 --> 08:44.696
replace me as the matriarch.

08:45.096 --> 08:46.456
Mother.

08:51.456 --> 08:53.436
Although you've been freed,

08:53.456 --> 08:54.836
from now on,

08:54.856 --> 08:57.076
watch what you say and do.

08:57.096 --> 09:00.196
Don't make mistakes ever again.

09:00.216 --> 09:01.956
Yes, Mother.

09:01.976 --> 09:03.816
I'll keep that in mind.

09:05.576 --> 09:06.936
Let me do it.

09:10.336 --> 09:11.696
Mother,

09:13.616 --> 09:15.856
when I was sick,

09:16.056 --> 09:19.336
you managed everything at home. Thanks.

09:19.376 --> 09:21.616
I'm glad you know it.

09:21.616 --> 09:25.116
I reflected on myself

09:25.136 --> 09:27.936
in my room in the last few days.

09:28.096 --> 09:31.716
I failed to run the household well,

09:31.736 --> 09:34.116
unlike Si. Look,

09:34.136 --> 09:36.596
she's kept everything in order.

09:36.616 --> 09:39.176
Even Zhan has become better.

09:39.376 --> 09:41.056
I heard he started

09:41.056 --> 09:42.376
practicing martial arts.

09:42.376 --> 09:45.296
They were fooling around.

09:45.696 --> 09:48.736
I noticed a girl

09:48.736 --> 09:50.336
in our mansion

09:50.336 --> 09:52.356
who I had never seen before.

09:52.376 --> 09:55.436
She and Zhan

09:55.456 --> 09:58.796
seemed quite close.

09:58.816 --> 10:00.816
Who was that?

10:01.256 --> 10:02.096
Mrs. Li,

10:02.106 --> 10:03.476
do you know her?

10:03.496 --> 10:04.976
My Lady,

10:05.336 --> 10:07.216
she's Miss Si's friend,

10:07.216 --> 10:08.596
Lu Chuchu.

10:08.616 --> 10:10.296
Her background is unknown.

10:10.456 --> 10:12.316
Refugees have been

10:12.336 --> 10:14.196
sneaking into the city lately.

10:14.216 --> 10:16.816
What if she's one of them?

10:16.816 --> 10:17.956
A refugee?

10:17.976 --> 10:20.036
That's fine

10:20.056 --> 10:22.336
as long as she's honest,

10:22.616 --> 10:24.456
and Zhan likes her.

10:24.736 --> 10:25.816
I agree, Mother.

10:25.816 --> 10:27.576
You're right.

10:28.856 --> 10:30.476
Just now,

10:30.496 --> 10:31.336
we saw her

10:31.346 --> 10:33.576
on the way here.

10:33.936 --> 10:36.836
She looked like a tough girl.

10:36.856 --> 10:38.956
I wonder why a Han like her

10:38.976 --> 10:41.456
was dressed as a Tartar.

10:41.936 --> 10:42.836
My Lady,

10:42.856 --> 10:44.696
a few days ago, I saw her

10:44.696 --> 10:46.056
feeding Young Master Zhan

10:46.056 --> 10:47.436
in the garden.

10:47.456 --> 10:49.376
Actually, they were feeding each other.

10:49.376 --> 10:50.856
She was as if seducing him.

10:50.856 --> 10:52.716
Alright, that's enough.

10:52.736 --> 10:54.696
What nonsense is that?

10:55.616 --> 10:56.956
Don't be mad, Mother.

10:56.976 --> 10:58.576
Please calm down.

11:00.576 --> 11:04.216
If she really is like what Mrs. Li said,

11:04.696 --> 11:07.196
that girl is dishonest.

11:07.216 --> 11:09.356
Zhan's marriage is one thing.

11:09.376 --> 11:11.096
We can't risk

11:11.096 --> 11:12.736
the honor of our clan.

11:12.736 --> 11:13.716
Stop.

11:13.736 --> 11:15.336
Say no more.

11:15.576 --> 11:17.456
I won't allow anyone in our house

11:17.456 --> 11:19.316
to marry a mysterious girl like her!

11:19.336 --> 11:20.696
Yes.

11:30.096 --> 11:32.176
Greetings, Grandmother.

11:32.616 --> 11:34.316
Why did you ask to see me?

11:34.336 --> 11:35.696
Zhan,

11:36.216 --> 11:40.036
what's the relationship between you

11:40.056 --> 11:42.096
and Miss Lu Chuchu?

11:42.976 --> 11:45.196
She's Commandant Yu's friend,

11:45.216 --> 11:47.456
and she's made friends with Si, too.

11:47.856 --> 11:51.096
How... how did she

11:51.096 --> 11:53.256
and Commandant Yu meet?

11:53.256 --> 11:55.856
They've known each other since childhood.

11:57.216 --> 11:58.256
Why are you suddenly

11:58.256 --> 12:00.336
taking an interest in her?

12:00.976 --> 12:03.336
What I'm saying is

12:03.616 --> 12:06.836
if you like her,

12:06.856 --> 12:09.076
you should tell me.

12:09.096 --> 12:11.456
But ask yourself

12:11.616 --> 12:12.616
how well

12:12.616 --> 12:14.696
you know her.

12:14.736 --> 12:15.936
You're familiar

12:15.936 --> 12:16.856
with our family rules.

12:16.856 --> 12:18.336
Mysterious

12:18.336 --> 12:20.316
and dishonest girls like her

12:20.336 --> 12:22.216
will not be accepted by our clan!

12:22.216 --> 12:23.576
Grandmother,

12:23.736 --> 12:26.196
you're biased against her.

12:26.216 --> 12:27.196
First,

12:27.216 --> 12:28.336
she and I

12:28.336 --> 12:29.956
are just friends.

12:29.976 --> 12:31.796
Nothing else is going on between us.

12:31.816 --> 12:33.856
Second, she's

12:33.856 --> 12:35.456
General-in-chief Huaihua's daughter.

12:35.456 --> 12:37.696
How is she mysterious?

12:38.056 --> 12:39.836
What? General-in-chief Huaihua

12:39.856 --> 12:42.436
is her... father?

12:42.456 --> 12:43.816
Correct.

12:45.496 --> 12:47.256
He's well-known and awe-inspiring,

12:47.256 --> 12:49.956
having killed countless enemies

12:49.976 --> 12:51.736
and achieved notable merits.

12:51.736 --> 12:53.736
He's a war hero!

12:55.056 --> 12:56.436
Is...

12:56.456 --> 12:58.096
what you said true?

12:58.096 --> 12:59.476
Of course.

12:59.496 --> 13:00.436
Besides,

13:00.456 --> 13:02.096
she helped those in need

13:02.096 --> 13:03.336
along the way

13:03.336 --> 13:04.456
and spent all her money

13:04.456 --> 13:06.096
on refugees.

13:06.216 --> 13:08.196
How could you call her dishonest?

13:08.216 --> 13:12.196
She spent all her money on refugees?

13:12.216 --> 13:15.236
She has a heart of gold.

13:15.256 --> 13:16.196
She does.

13:16.216 --> 13:17.856
Don't listen to those rumors others said.

13:17.856 --> 13:19.536
Let me pour you some water.

13:20.976 --> 13:22.216
You can relax, My Lady.

13:22.216 --> 13:23.576
Mother.

13:23.736 --> 13:25.736
Mother, Lu Chuchu

13:25.736 --> 13:27.736
is terrible!

13:28.616 --> 13:30.096
You had me tell her

13:30.096 --> 13:31.596
to stay away from Zhan, right?

13:31.616 --> 13:33.376
She was ill-mannered

13:33.376 --> 13:35.696
and extremely mean to me!

13:36.256 --> 13:37.616
Aunt Xiao.

13:41.976 --> 13:43.336
Zhan?

13:49.056 --> 13:50.886
Who did you mean?

14:29.216 --> 14:30.476
Chief,

14:30.496 --> 14:32.056
I get it.

14:32.616 --> 14:34.976
You have feelings for Miss Si.

14:39.216 --> 14:40.936
But what I don't get is

14:41.096 --> 14:43.416
if you like her, why not take action?

14:44.336 --> 14:45.916
Even a scholar like Mr. Zhen

14:45.936 --> 14:47.916
went uphill to gather Lan-tsao

14:47.936 --> 14:49.856
for Miss Si.

14:49.876 --> 14:50.736
If it were me,

14:50.736 --> 14:52.936
I'd be so touched as to marry him.

14:54.616 --> 14:56.216
So what if he got a pot?

14:56.456 --> 14:58.216
I can gather 100 pots!

14:58.456 --> 14:59.866
If he... he thinks he can

14:59.886 --> 15:00.736
be a fighter,

15:00.736 --> 15:02.216
then I can be a scholar.

15:03.336 --> 15:05.556
One pot of plant makes a decent gift.

15:05.576 --> 15:07.536
100 pots are ridiculous.

15:08.336 --> 15:09.816
What is love?

15:10.256 --> 15:13.336
It's intangible and romantic.

15:13.696 --> 15:15.136
It spreads

15:15.136 --> 15:17.096
behind the unspoken words.

15:17.216 --> 15:19.796
Your simple and crude idea

15:19.816 --> 15:21.956
will only ruin the romance

15:21.976 --> 15:24.056
and its misty beauty.

15:24.736 --> 15:27.336
Do you have a better idea?

15:28.576 --> 15:30.596
People used to convey love by letter.

15:30.616 --> 15:31.596
Now,

15:31.616 --> 15:33.936
we can use crabapple flowers.

15:35.936 --> 15:36.956
Chief said

15:36.976 --> 15:38.136
a fighter like him

15:38.136 --> 15:39.956
didn't know how to look after plants.

15:39.976 --> 15:40.856
Leaves

15:40.856 --> 15:42.476
of this pot of crabapple keep falling.

15:42.496 --> 15:43.576
It might be caused

15:43.576 --> 15:45.716
by the soil.

15:45.736 --> 15:47.976
He had me bring this pot to Miss Si to...

15:47.976 --> 15:48.936
If you couldn't tend it,

15:48.936 --> 15:50.716
you'd better stay away from all plants.

15:50.736 --> 15:52.536
Hey, I'm not done yet.

15:52.696 --> 15:54.576
Why is she mad?

15:55.456 --> 15:57.856
Was I being too subtle?

16:00.216 --> 16:01.576
Nah.

16:01.736 --> 16:02.696
Once Miss Si digs,

16:02.696 --> 16:04.056
she'll see it.

16:05.336 --> 16:06.256
That day,

16:06.256 --> 16:07.696
I meant to take the chance

16:07.696 --> 16:08.856
to clear the air with Mr. Zhen

16:08.856 --> 16:10.356
and his mother,

16:10.376 --> 16:12.676
but I couldn't say no to them

16:12.696 --> 16:14.936
and didn't get to make it clear.

16:15.096 --> 16:17.816
It's better to leave it that way.

16:18.856 --> 16:20.796
Miss, I've begun to think

16:20.816 --> 16:22.576
Mr. Zhen is really nice.

16:22.976 --> 16:24.216
As quiet as he seems,

16:24.216 --> 16:26.076
he likes you wholeheartedly.

16:26.096 --> 16:27.456
To gather this pot of Lan-tsao,

16:27.456 --> 16:30.456
he cut his hand and lost blood.

16:30.976 --> 16:33.056
Unlike Mr. Yu who returned

16:33.056 --> 16:35.176
the crabapple from you.

16:35.336 --> 16:36.736
He took an arrow

16:36.736 --> 16:38.356
for you

16:38.376 --> 16:40.416
and almost lost his life.

16:40.496 --> 16:42.076
He helped you out again

16:42.096 --> 16:43.936
on Lady Jiang's birthday.

16:44.576 --> 16:45.456
But...

16:45.456 --> 16:46.356
Aman,

16:46.376 --> 16:48.936
forget about Mr. Yu.

16:49.376 --> 16:50.956
Don't worry.

16:50.976 --> 16:52.796
Mr. Zhen is a wonderful man,

16:52.816 --> 16:54.376
but

16:54.616 --> 16:56.936
he can't make my heart flutter.

16:57.696 --> 16:58.656
I simply

16:58.656 --> 17:00.556
appreciate him as a friend.

17:00.576 --> 17:02.176
That's not love.

17:03.576 --> 17:05.536
If no one

17:05.536 --> 17:07.736
can make my heart flutter,

17:07.896 --> 17:10.256
I'll remain single forever.

17:10.616 --> 17:12.696
Things are going so well now.

17:12.776 --> 17:14.596
I have Zhan, my father,

17:14.616 --> 17:16.316
and you with me.

17:16.336 --> 17:17.936
This is great.

17:18.136 --> 17:19.536
I'm more than content.

17:20.896 --> 17:22.256
Am I right?

17:33.296 --> 17:35.336
(Fragrant Dew)

17:35.336 --> 17:38.036
Are you sure it's Jiang Si's shop?

17:38.056 --> 17:39.416
Yes.

17:41.056 --> 17:42.416
Your Grace,

17:42.616 --> 17:44.796
my wife used to own that shop.

17:44.816 --> 17:47.456
It was a lucrative business.

17:48.776 --> 17:49.776
Jiang Si

17:49.776 --> 17:50.916
must've

17:50.936 --> 17:51.776
tricked my wife

17:51.776 --> 17:53.596
into giving away that shop.

17:53.616 --> 17:55.376
You couldn't even

17:55.776 --> 17:58.176
control a businesswoman you married.

17:58.336 --> 18:01.016
And here you are complaining to me?

18:01.336 --> 18:03.216
I'm sorry, Your Grace.

18:05.096 --> 18:07.316
I am but a scholar.

18:07.336 --> 18:08.916
I'm too kind

18:08.936 --> 18:09.816
to deal with

18:09.816 --> 18:12.116
that deep and scheming woman.

18:12.136 --> 18:13.936
What's wrong with women?

18:14.096 --> 18:15.916
Weren't you born by one?

18:15.936 --> 18:17.836
You're incompetent.

18:17.856 --> 18:19.976
Don't blame it on a woman.

18:21.656 --> 18:23.976
This perfume smells good.

18:24.256 --> 18:26.776
I wonder if it works as well.

18:27.096 --> 18:29.296
Your Grace, are you...?

18:29.296 --> 18:31.656
I'm not you.

18:31.936 --> 18:34.416
Those who annoyed me

18:35.416 --> 18:37.676
will suffer for sure.

18:37.696 --> 18:41.216
(Fragrance Shop)

18:41.256 --> 18:42.696
Look, everyone!

18:42.696 --> 18:44.616
Come and look!

18:44.616 --> 18:46.896
This shop is a trap!

18:46.896 --> 18:48.856
It's run by heartless animals!

18:48.856 --> 18:50.616
We used their balm

18:50.616 --> 18:52.136
and grew rashes all over the face!

18:52.136 --> 18:53.936
Look at my face!

18:53.936 --> 18:56.156
Look, everyone! Look!

18:56.176 --> 18:57.116
Ladies,

18:57.136 --> 18:58.916
why are you making a scene in my shop?

18:58.936 --> 19:00.236
Why?

19:00.256 --> 19:01.856
Look at me, everyone!

19:01.856 --> 19:02.756
Look!

19:02.776 --> 19:03.936
The balm I bought

19:03.936 --> 19:04.856
from this shop

19:04.856 --> 19:06.056
ruined my face.

19:06.056 --> 19:07.536
This shop is a trap.

19:07.536 --> 19:09.236
It's a trap!

19:09.256 --> 19:11.136
How could I live on?

19:11.136 --> 19:12.836
How heartless!

19:12.856 --> 19:14.156
How dare you sell such poison!

19:14.176 --> 19:15.696
Aren't you afraid of karma?

19:15.696 --> 19:17.496
No one will buy their products again!

19:17.496 --> 19:19.176
It's a trap! A trap!

19:19.186 --> 19:20.056
Trash it!

19:20.056 --> 19:21.296
Smash everything!

19:21.296 --> 19:23.536
Trash it! Trash it!

19:23.536 --> 19:27.656
- Smash!
- Smash!

19:29.256 --> 19:31.136
Nobody moves!

19:32.576 --> 19:34.176
Are you hitting her?

19:34.306 --> 19:35.376
Help!

19:35.376 --> 19:37.336
She's hitting us! Help!

19:37.336 --> 19:38.616
She's violent!

19:38.616 --> 19:40.916
Chuchu, let her go.

19:40.936 --> 19:41.876
Jiang Si...

19:41.896 --> 19:42.996
Let her go, Chuchu.

19:43.016 --> 19:44.136
We demand an explanation.

19:44.136 --> 19:45.996
How dare she hit her!

19:46.016 --> 19:47.316
- Yes.
- That's right.

19:47.336 --> 19:48.736
Sorry about this.

19:49.536 --> 19:50.416
Ma'am,

19:50.416 --> 19:51.696
where's the rest

19:51.696 --> 19:52.616
of the balm you used?

19:52.616 --> 19:54.176
May I take a look?

19:55.656 --> 19:57.476
Don't try to destroy the evidence.

19:57.496 --> 19:58.816
We're all watching you.

19:58.816 --> 20:00.396
Yes. Right.

20:00.416 --> 20:01.596
That's right.

20:01.616 --> 20:02.816
Don't worry.

20:02.816 --> 20:04.896
I'll test it right here.

20:04.936 --> 20:06.096
Rou'er, show them

20:06.096 --> 20:07.696
the rest of all our balm.

20:08.616 --> 20:10.416
Pick any jar

20:10.416 --> 20:11.776
from our stock.

20:11.776 --> 20:13.936
I'll test it right in front of you.

20:17.336 --> 20:20.176
Rou'er, bring me the picked ones.

20:21.056 --> 20:22.416
Sure.

20:23.096 --> 20:24.776
You said the balm from our shop

20:24.776 --> 20:25.996
ruined your face.

20:26.016 --> 20:28.216
I'll test it myself here and now.

20:34.696 --> 20:36.616
She used this jar.

20:38.016 --> 20:39.136
Take a look

20:39.136 --> 20:40.616
at these two jars

20:40.616 --> 20:41.636
and smell them.

20:41.656 --> 20:43.556
Take a sniff, everyone.

20:43.576 --> 20:44.856
Their scents are different.

20:44.856 --> 20:47.096
They aren't the same.

20:47.096 --> 20:48.336
They smell differently, right?

20:48.336 --> 20:49.496
Yes, how come?

20:49.496 --> 20:51.096
That's right. She added

20:51.096 --> 20:52.256
Ruyi Grass

20:52.256 --> 20:54.236
to the balm she used.

20:54.256 --> 20:56.316
That's a poisonous plant

20:56.336 --> 20:57.696
that's corrosive to the skin.

20:57.696 --> 20:59.536
What grass? I've never heard of it.

20:59.536 --> 21:00.776
It was your balm

21:00.776 --> 21:02.116
that disfigured my face!

21:02.136 --> 21:03.876
This shop is to blame!

21:03.896 --> 21:05.376
- It's a trap!
- If you insist on

21:05.376 --> 21:07.156
making groundless accusations,

21:07.176 --> 21:08.916
let's go to court.

21:08.936 --> 21:10.696
We aren't afraid of being checked.

21:10.696 --> 21:11.616
Sue me.

21:11.616 --> 21:12.576
I'm not scared!

21:12.576 --> 21:14.096
Your shop is a trap, indeed!

21:14.096 --> 21:16.036
Aman, go to the Capital Security Office.

21:16.056 --> 21:17.816
Ask their officials to come here

21:17.816 --> 21:19.056
to uphold justice.

21:19.056 --> 21:20.416
Yes.

21:21.176 --> 21:22.616
Go ahead and sue me!

21:22.616 --> 21:24.096
You're selling poison!

21:24.096 --> 21:25.096
- You're evil!
- Yes!

21:25.096 --> 21:26.016
You bribed officials.

21:26.016 --> 21:27.096
This shop is a trap!

21:27.096 --> 21:29.616
It's a trap! A trap!

21:29.616 --> 21:31.156
Stop! Come back!

21:31.176 --> 21:32.536
Chuchu.

21:32.576 --> 21:33.476
Let them go.

21:33.496 --> 21:35.096
But they...

21:35.616 --> 21:37.076
You saw everything.

21:37.096 --> 21:38.616
Isn't it clear who's guilty?

21:38.616 --> 21:41.176
They came to make a scene on purpose.

21:41.656 --> 21:43.096
Rou'er, fetch

21:43.096 --> 21:44.936
the new fragrant tablets we made

21:44.936 --> 21:46.516
and give them to the ladies.

21:46.536 --> 21:47.376
Go home

21:47.376 --> 21:48.556
and try them.

21:48.576 --> 21:50.336
See for yourself

21:50.336 --> 21:52.036
the quality of our products.

21:52.056 --> 21:53.136
- Thanks.
- It smells nice.

21:53.136 --> 21:53.936
Thanks.

21:53.936 --> 21:55.016
Thank you, Miss.

21:55.016 --> 21:55.956
So fragrant.

21:55.956 --> 21:56.816
I like its aroma.

21:56.816 --> 21:57.656
Jiang Si,

21:57.666 --> 21:58.776
why did you stop me

21:58.776 --> 22:00.076
from chasing them just now?

22:00.096 --> 22:01.656
I'm afraid

22:01.856 --> 22:03.496
there's more to this matter.

22:09.256 --> 22:11.776
(Haitang Chamber)

22:23.096 --> 22:24.736
Have some tea.

22:24.816 --> 22:26.916
You've been doing the accounts all night.

22:29.336 --> 22:31.036
They smashed away

22:31.056 --> 22:32.416
six months' profits

22:32.416 --> 22:33.776
earlier today.

22:35.416 --> 22:37.356
We had finally had some spare money.

22:37.376 --> 22:39.876
Also, you had paid a lot to run the mansion.

22:39.896 --> 22:42.016
What should we do now?

22:44.016 --> 22:46.296
Even if we sell all the valuables here,

22:46.296 --> 22:47.856
it's still not enough.

22:48.176 --> 22:50.616
How about we borrow some money

22:50.616 --> 22:51.836
from Qiaoniang?

22:51.856 --> 22:53.216
We can't.

22:53.336 --> 22:54.916
I've annoyed Duke An's Mansion.

22:54.936 --> 22:55.816
If others find out

22:55.816 --> 22:57.016
that she helped me,

22:57.036 --> 22:59.306
how can she keep a foothold in their mansion?

23:00.866 --> 23:01.896
I'll figure something out.

23:01.896 --> 23:04.536
(Morning Drizzle)

23:08.896 --> 23:10.256
Er'niu!

23:13.536 --> 23:14.896
Miss.

23:16.856 --> 23:17.696
What are these?

23:17.696 --> 23:18.836
Banknotes!

23:18.856 --> 23:20.016
1,000 taels altogether!

23:20.016 --> 23:21.236
(500 Taels)

23:21.256 --> 23:22.096
Er'niu,

23:22.096 --> 23:23.496
you aren't a dog

23:23.496 --> 23:24.536
but the God of Wealth.

23:24.536 --> 23:26.096
But he took so much money

23:26.096 --> 23:26.936
from whom?

23:26.946 --> 23:27.916
Who else could it be

23:27.936 --> 23:28.876
but Mr. Yu?

23:28.896 --> 23:30.456
Him?

23:30.776 --> 23:31.616
Miss,

23:31.616 --> 23:33.636
could they be forged?

23:33.656 --> 23:35.016
How could he have

23:35.016 --> 23:35.856
so much money?

23:35.856 --> 23:36.696
Forged?

23:36.706 --> 23:37.576
He doesn't

23:37.576 --> 23:39.896
seem too rich.

23:40.016 --> 23:41.896
Yes. He lives in a small house.

23:41.896 --> 23:43.316
Nothing he eats, wears, or uses

23:43.336 --> 23:44.796
seems expensive.

23:44.816 --> 23:45.836
Miss,

23:45.856 --> 23:46.856
looks like I was wrong

23:46.856 --> 23:47.996
about him.

23:48.016 --> 23:49.336
Mr. Yu is the one

23:49.336 --> 23:50.896
who's obsessed with you.

23:50.916 --> 23:51.776
That's not

23:51.776 --> 23:53.636
what you said the other day.

23:53.656 --> 23:54.856
A friend in need is

23:54.856 --> 23:56.356
a friend indeed, right?

23:56.376 --> 23:57.356
Think about it.

23:57.376 --> 23:59.476
A poor man like him

23:59.496 --> 24:01.176
must've used every possible means

24:01.176 --> 24:02.776
to gather 1,000 tales,

24:02.776 --> 24:04.676
and he gave it all to you.

24:04.696 --> 24:06.896
If that's not true love, what else is?

24:06.896 --> 24:07.756
Aman,

24:07.776 --> 24:09.276
did he borrow it from a loan shark?

24:09.296 --> 24:11.536
The compound interest is disastrous!

24:13.496 --> 24:14.856
Er'niu.

24:43.776 --> 24:45.136
Mr. Yu...

24:46.896 --> 24:48.456
Are you taking a walk?

24:50.376 --> 24:52.456
I'm bringing Er'niu back.

24:53.256 --> 24:54.696
I can tell.

24:57.016 --> 24:58.076
Mr. Yu,

24:58.096 --> 25:00.856
(500 Taels)
I can't take your 1,000 taels.

25:01.016 --> 25:02.336
Your shop was smashed.

25:02.336 --> 25:04.076
Aren't you in urgent need of money?

25:04.096 --> 25:05.096
Even so,

25:05.096 --> 25:07.096
I can't take your banknotes.

25:08.016 --> 25:09.156
By the way,

25:09.176 --> 25:11.936
are they really yours?

25:12.096 --> 25:13.396
Of course.

25:13.416 --> 25:14.616
The salary from your office

25:14.616 --> 25:16.076
isn't that high, is it?

25:16.096 --> 25:18.116
Long Dan collects it every month.

25:18.136 --> 25:19.576
Do you not know how much

25:19.576 --> 25:20.556
you earn every month?

25:20.576 --> 25:21.756
No.

25:21.776 --> 25:23.096
Are 1,000 taels not enough?

25:23.096 --> 25:23.956
I can give you more.

25:23.966 --> 25:25.936
No, no. It's enough.

25:27.496 --> 25:29.096
You're much richer

25:29.576 --> 25:31.116
than I thought.

25:31.136 --> 25:33.456
Money isn't important.

25:34.056 --> 25:35.576
Only the rich

25:35.576 --> 25:38.076
can say so.

25:38.096 --> 25:40.036
I'm not that rich.

25:40.056 --> 25:42.236
Anyway, I can't take your banknotes.

25:42.256 --> 25:43.276
Take them back.

25:43.296 --> 25:45.836
I don't need money at all.

25:45.856 --> 25:47.176
You need it now,

25:47.176 --> 25:48.696
so take it.

25:48.696 --> 25:49.616
Don't be shy.

25:49.616 --> 25:51.676
- I...
- Miss, are you done?

25:51.696 --> 25:53.316
Someone is coming!

25:53.336 --> 25:54.936
Oh, I see.

25:56.466 --> 25:57.336
It's my problem.

25:57.336 --> 25:58.916
I'll take care of it.

25:58.936 --> 26:01.236
Here are your banknotes.

26:01.256 --> 26:02.296
You...

26:02.296 --> 26:03.256
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

26:03.256 --> 26:05.136
Hold on. Wait!

26:05.176 --> 26:06.536
I'll invest

26:06.776 --> 26:09.656
the money in your shop.

26:09.936 --> 26:12.076
Give me a cut at the end of the year.

26:12.096 --> 26:13.516
Didn't you say

26:13.536 --> 26:15.876
money should be used to make money?

26:15.896 --> 26:17.696
If I left these banknotes in a cupboard,

26:17.696 --> 26:19.356
they might be chipped away

26:19.376 --> 26:21.176
by worms or rats.

26:21.376 --> 26:24.896
Alright. Fine.

26:25.896 --> 26:28.076
I'll take 500 taels.

26:28.096 --> 26:29.616
Thanks for your help.

26:46.056 --> 26:47.416
Don't turn around.

26:52.016 --> 26:53.656
Do not move.

27:09.696 --> 27:11.176
How useless!

27:11.296 --> 27:13.316
(Friends Gather Together)
She came out.

27:13.336 --> 27:16.176
You should've used that matter
against Jiang Si.

27:17.136 --> 27:18.356
But what happened?

27:18.376 --> 27:20.156
She used it against you!

27:20.176 --> 27:21.556
It was my fault.

27:21.576 --> 27:23.056
I didn't recognize

27:23.056 --> 27:23.996
that she was Jiang Si.

27:24.016 --> 27:25.356
Idiot!

27:25.376 --> 27:26.776
Cousin,

27:27.656 --> 27:28.576
is she the best one

27:28.576 --> 27:30.496
you chose to take revenge for me?

27:30.896 --> 27:33.036
She was a member of the Linglong Troupe.

27:33.056 --> 27:34.696
I thought she was smart

27:34.696 --> 27:36.076
and good with words.

27:36.096 --> 27:38.936
I didn't know she'd be so useless.

27:39.056 --> 27:40.396
Get lost!

27:40.416 --> 27:41.996
Get out of Her Grace's sight!

27:42.016 --> 27:43.976
- Yes.
- Wait.

27:46.336 --> 27:48.776
Did I allow you to leave?

27:48.816 --> 27:51.776
If you're so bad with words,

27:52.696 --> 27:54.536
don't bother

27:54.576 --> 27:56.696
to speak ever again.

27:56.856 --> 27:58.216
Drag her out

27:58.496 --> 28:00.376
and silence her.

28:00.896 --> 28:01.916
Guards!

28:01.936 --> 28:03.496
Spare me, Your Grace!

28:03.496 --> 28:04.336
Your Grace!

28:04.336 --> 28:05.236
Young Master!

28:05.256 --> 28:06.856
Help me, Young Master!

28:06.856 --> 28:09.696
Young Master! Please!

28:09.856 --> 28:11.936
Do you want to help her?

28:12.186 --> 28:13.206
Of course not.

28:13.226 --> 28:15.096
I can't care less about a performer.

28:15.096 --> 28:16.656
Very well.

28:16.816 --> 28:19.376
It's better to have her muted

28:20.136 --> 28:22.376
when she doesn't know what to say

28:22.656 --> 28:27.016
or say what she shouldn't have.

28:27.336 --> 28:29.316
Trust me, Your Grace.

28:29.336 --> 28:31.376
I won't say a word about this matter

28:31.376 --> 28:32.916
to Uncle.

28:32.936 --> 28:34.876
You're my cousin.

28:34.896 --> 28:36.776
I certainly trust you.

28:38.416 --> 28:40.016
But

28:40.616 --> 28:41.536
look at the people

28:41.536 --> 28:43.376
you found:

28:44.176 --> 28:46.316
a stupid performer

28:46.336 --> 28:48.456
and a useless scholar.

28:48.536 --> 28:50.036
Ji Chongyi,

28:50.056 --> 28:52.536
your father is a duke.

28:52.936 --> 28:55.096
He might not be powerful,

28:55.256 --> 28:57.216
but he holds a rank.

29:01.136 --> 29:02.836
You're right, Your Grace.

29:02.856 --> 29:04.856
You can hold others in awe.

29:04.896 --> 29:06.616
I admire you for that.

29:06.776 --> 29:08.156
I know Jiang Si all too well.

29:08.176 --> 29:09.616
She's calculative

29:09.616 --> 29:11.456
and thick-skinned.

29:11.776 --> 29:13.136
She went to Capital Security

29:13.136 --> 29:14.696
to cancel our engagement.

29:15.176 --> 29:16.316
I bet

29:16.336 --> 29:17.916
both Zhen Heng and Yu Qi

29:17.936 --> 29:20.036
of that office are her lovers.

29:20.056 --> 29:20.916
The two of them

29:20.936 --> 29:22.916
are known to be tough.

29:22.936 --> 29:23.776
It wouldn't be wise

29:23.776 --> 29:25.316
to set her up

29:25.336 --> 29:26.676
in the open.

29:26.696 --> 29:28.856
That office again!

29:30.336 --> 29:31.616
Do you think

29:31.616 --> 29:33.516
I'm afraid of them?

29:33.536 --> 29:35.236
You aren't, of course.

29:35.256 --> 29:37.596
But we're right

29:37.616 --> 29:39.156
under His Majesty's nose.

29:39.176 --> 29:40.676
If we made too big a fuss,

29:40.696 --> 29:43.316
and the General and Grand Princess found out,

29:43.336 --> 29:46.156
it wouldn't be worth it.

29:46.176 --> 29:47.996
It's hard to deal with Jiang Si,

29:48.016 --> 29:49.596
but her brother, Jiang Zhan,

29:49.616 --> 29:51.096
is a fool

29:51.096 --> 29:53.556
and an easy target.

29:53.576 --> 29:55.376
She cares about him

29:55.376 --> 29:56.876
the most.

29:56.896 --> 29:58.876
It'll be much easier to destroy her

29:58.896 --> 30:00.696
by using him.

30:06.696 --> 30:08.116
Bad news!

30:08.136 --> 30:09.496
Bad news!

30:11.496 --> 30:13.236
Bad news, Miss!

30:13.256 --> 30:14.836
Young Master Zhan has gone missing again.

30:14.836 --> 30:17.096
(Haitang Chamber)
Miss!

30:20.336 --> 30:21.936
Master, Master!

30:22.536 --> 30:23.476
Found him?

30:23.496 --> 30:24.856
He isn't anywhere here.

30:24.856 --> 30:25.896
Check the east courtyard.

30:25.896 --> 30:26.736
Yes.

30:26.746 --> 30:28.296
Master, he's not in the places

30:28.296 --> 30:29.616
where he'd go fishing!

30:29.616 --> 30:30.916
What about the tea house?

30:30.936 --> 30:31.896
Go there and look!

30:31.896 --> 30:33.256
Yes.

30:34.056 --> 30:35.316
Si,

30:35.336 --> 30:37.696
calm down, will you?

30:37.856 --> 30:39.576
He used to hang out

30:39.576 --> 30:40.696
every few days.

30:40.716 --> 30:41.616
Don't worry too much.

30:41.616 --> 30:42.896
He'll come back when he's tired.

30:42.896 --> 30:44.876
Father, this time is different.

30:44.896 --> 30:46.176
He'll be in danger!

30:46.176 --> 30:47.096
He's an adult.

30:47.096 --> 30:48.176
What could've happened?

30:48.176 --> 30:49.696
Trust me. Things have changed.

30:49.696 --> 30:52.116
It's you who have changed.

30:52.136 --> 30:53.296
In the last few days,

30:53.296 --> 30:54.556
you had him grounded,

30:54.576 --> 30:55.716
making him learn martial arts

30:55.716 --> 30:57.036
and read books.

30:57.056 --> 30:58.336
I was surprised

30:58.336 --> 30:59.296
that he didn't run out

30:59.296 --> 31:01.416
until today.

31:03.856 --> 31:05.636
Miss Si, Master.

31:05.656 --> 31:06.696
How did it go, Master Qin?

31:06.696 --> 31:07.556
Found anything?

31:07.576 --> 31:09.316
No. I checked every corner of this house.

31:09.336 --> 31:10.376
I also checked the places

31:10.376 --> 31:12.276
where he'd go for drinks, music, and cuju

31:12.296 --> 31:13.156
as you said

31:13.176 --> 31:14.536
but found nothing.

31:16.096 --> 31:17.496
The riverside.

31:17.856 --> 31:19.856
Go to the riverside!

31:20.016 --> 31:21.456
Mr. Yu!

31:22.096 --> 31:22.976
Mr. Zhen!

31:22.976 --> 31:24.376
(Capital Security Office, Court)

31:24.376 --> 31:25.616
Miss Si sent me to seek help.

31:25.616 --> 31:26.816
Young Master Zhan is missing.

31:26.816 --> 31:28.176
Please gather enough people

31:28.176 --> 31:29.756
to help us find him.

31:29.776 --> 31:31.036
How long

31:31.056 --> 31:31.936
has he been missing?

31:31.936 --> 31:34.076
It's been half a day since this morning.

31:34.096 --> 31:35.416
He's an adult.

31:35.416 --> 31:36.596
It's only been a few hours.

31:36.616 --> 31:37.676
He's not missing yet.

31:37.696 --> 31:38.936
Our office can't take it

31:38.936 --> 31:39.916
as a missing person case.

31:39.936 --> 31:41.096
But Miss Si said

31:41.096 --> 31:43.156
he might die if we didn't find him in time.

31:43.176 --> 31:44.096
Long Dan, let's go.

31:44.096 --> 31:45.656
- Yes.
- Stop.

31:46.496 --> 31:47.576
It's against the law.

31:47.576 --> 31:48.696
If we had to find everyone

31:48.696 --> 31:49.936
who went missing

31:49.936 --> 31:51.076
for a few hours in town,

31:51.096 --> 31:52.556
our system would be destroyed.

31:52.576 --> 31:54.736
You're right. Let's go.

32:03.376 --> 32:04.486
Did you find anything?

32:04.506 --> 32:05.416
No.

32:05.416 --> 32:06.536
What about you guys here?

32:06.536 --> 32:08.196
- Nothing.
- Anything there?

32:08.216 --> 32:09.076
No.

32:09.096 --> 32:10.916
What about you, Master Qin?

32:10.936 --> 32:12.296
Negative.

32:16.016 --> 32:17.376
Over here.

32:18.096 --> 32:19.936
This way, please.

32:20.536 --> 32:21.496
This is the best room

32:21.496 --> 32:22.836
we have.

32:22.856 --> 32:24.856
You won't get

32:24.856 --> 32:27.256
a better view anywhere else in town.

32:29.336 --> 32:30.416
Do you need a girl

32:30.416 --> 32:32.176
to play music or sing songs?

32:33.936 --> 32:36.416
Also, she can drink with you.
You'll have fun.

32:36.896 --> 32:38.396
I don't need anyone

32:38.416 --> 32:39.316
to play music or sing.

32:39.336 --> 32:40.976
Leave me alone.

32:41.696 --> 32:43.056
Sure. No problem.

32:46.776 --> 32:48.136
Thanks.

32:49.696 --> 32:51.316
Enjoy yourself.

32:51.336 --> 32:52.696
Sure.

33:00.416 --> 33:01.776
Again!

33:04.696 --> 33:06.056
Come on.

33:13.816 --> 33:15.176
Knock him down.

33:15.256 --> 33:16.856
- Get him!
- Another round!

33:17.136 --> 33:19.136
- How manly!
- Good.

33:23.136 --> 33:24.496
Get him!

33:26.896 --> 33:28.256
Get him!

33:32.056 --> 33:34.696
Pin him down!

33:36.336 --> 33:37.696
Get him!

33:39.096 --> 33:40.076
Get him!

33:40.096 --> 33:41.456
Zhan!

33:42.136 --> 33:44.076
- Si...
- Why are you here?

33:44.096 --> 33:45.076
Master Qin...

33:45.096 --> 33:46.976
We looked everywhere for you.

33:47.176 --> 33:49.836
I... I was watching
Imperial Insignia Guards wrestling.

33:49.856 --> 33:51.276
Go home with me.

33:51.296 --> 33:52.856
Stop running around, Zhan.

33:52.856 --> 33:54.076
Sure. I...

33:54.096 --> 33:55.496
Hey, Yu!

33:55.896 --> 33:57.196
You came, too.

33:57.216 --> 33:58.216
Help me, please.

33:58.216 --> 33:59.416
Si is crazy.

33:59.416 --> 34:01.256
She imprisoned me. Come on!

34:02.896 --> 34:05.736
Mr. Yu, thanks for your help today.

34:05.816 --> 34:07.916
I'll escort you two back.

34:07.936 --> 34:08.796
No need.

34:08.816 --> 34:10.596
I'll bring him back.

34:10.616 --> 34:11.516
Good day.

34:11.536 --> 34:14.236
Let's go home. Come on!

34:14.256 --> 34:16.576
Come to have dinner with us someday.

34:17.096 --> 34:19.136
Good day, Mr. Yu.

34:28.416 --> 34:29.736
Mr. Yu, thanks to you,

34:29.736 --> 34:31.896
we found Miss Si's brother.

34:31.936 --> 34:32.956
She made

34:32.976 --> 34:34.436
desserts for you and had me

34:34.456 --> 34:35.296
bring them over.

34:35.316 --> 34:37.076
No wonder they look familiar.

34:37.096 --> 34:38.756
We're friends.

34:38.776 --> 34:40.616
No need to thank me.

34:41.176 --> 34:42.996
Speaking of her,

34:43.016 --> 34:44.216
she kind of

34:44.216 --> 34:45.376
overreacted

34:45.376 --> 34:47.096
earlier today.

34:47.456 --> 34:49.216
Just to be sure,

34:49.256 --> 34:51.376
was everything alright at the Jiang's,

34:51.376 --> 34:53.976
or was there anything wrong with her brother?

34:55.056 --> 34:56.956
All seemed well

34:56.976 --> 34:59.176
except that there was something strange.

34:59.176 --> 35:00.396
What was it?

35:00.416 --> 35:01.756
Young Master Zhan said

35:01.776 --> 35:04.656
Miss Si had never been strict with him.

35:04.696 --> 35:06.076
But recently,

35:06.096 --> 35:07.716
she became a different person.

35:07.736 --> 35:09.766
She made him learn martial arts at home

35:10.016 --> 35:11.556
and had a physician

35:11.576 --> 35:12.996
come to take his pulse every day.

35:13.016 --> 35:14.096
Young Master Zhan

35:14.096 --> 35:15.436
kept complaining about it.

35:15.456 --> 35:16.436
Earlier today,

35:16.456 --> 35:17.916
he managed to sneak out.

35:17.936 --> 35:20.416
We looked everywhere for him.

35:22.176 --> 35:23.656
At first,

35:24.496 --> 35:25.916
I thought she was anxious

35:25.936 --> 35:28.376
because the Imperial Insignia Guard selection

35:28.376 --> 35:30.556
was in a few days.

35:30.576 --> 35:32.496
She wanted him to get ready at home.

35:32.616 --> 35:34.196
When I helped her look for him earlier,

35:34.216 --> 35:35.576
I noticed

35:35.936 --> 35:36.916
that she had replaced

35:36.936 --> 35:38.896
all the servants in his courtyard.

35:39.176 --> 35:43.136
She'd test

35:43.576 --> 35:44.616
everything he ate every day

35:44.616 --> 35:46.436
with a silver needle.

35:46.456 --> 35:48.656
I think she was paranoid

35:48.696 --> 35:50.076
just like she was today.

35:50.096 --> 35:51.616
He only hung out for a few hours,

35:51.616 --> 35:52.516
but she went crazy.

35:52.536 --> 35:54.536
Was it that bad?

35:55.816 --> 35:57.176
Is there someone trying to

35:57.176 --> 35:58.716
harm Jiang Zhan?

35:58.736 --> 36:00.176
He might be an earl's son,

36:00.176 --> 36:01.536
but he can't inherit the rank.

36:01.536 --> 36:03.636
Who'd waste their time harming him?

36:03.656 --> 36:05.016
You're wrong.

36:06.096 --> 36:07.596
Miss Si

36:07.616 --> 36:08.816
has always been cautious.

36:08.816 --> 36:11.116
She must've acted like this for a reason.

36:11.136 --> 36:12.496
Master Qin, you know,

36:13.176 --> 36:14.876
I'm also a martial artist.

36:14.896 --> 36:17.136
I'll go with you tomorrow.

36:17.296 --> 36:18.496
If Miss Si

36:18.496 --> 36:20.556
still has concerns,

36:20.576 --> 36:23.036
she can come along, too.

36:23.056 --> 36:24.276
That'd be great.

36:24.296 --> 36:26.436
I'll relay your message to her.

36:26.456 --> 36:27.816
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

36:28.536 --> 36:29.896
Cheers.

36:36.496 --> 36:40.016
(Zhou)

36:41.256 --> 36:43.296
I'm off duty today.

36:43.616 --> 36:45.616
Jiang Zhan can't stay indoors all the time.

36:45.616 --> 36:47.896
It's bad for his mood and health.

36:48.696 --> 36:49.636
I'll teach him.

36:49.656 --> 36:52.536
Master Qin is here with us as well.

36:53.296 --> 36:55.856
No need to worry, Miss Si.

36:55.936 --> 36:57.896
I appreciate your help, Mr. Yu.

36:57.936 --> 36:59.896
I'll leave you guys alone, Zhan.

37:05.616 --> 37:08.816
You're really good!

37:09.256 --> 37:10.636
You volunteered to teach me

37:10.656 --> 37:12.856
to ride and shoot to help me out.

37:13.176 --> 37:14.536
Thanks, man.

37:14.576 --> 37:16.016
You're welcome, man.

37:16.456 --> 37:18.136
Well then,

37:18.176 --> 37:20.096
keep a squatting stance for one hour first

37:20.116 --> 37:20.996
to warm up.

37:21.016 --> 37:23.216
Sure. One hour...

37:23.576 --> 37:24.596
Wait.

37:24.616 --> 37:25.536
Look at me.

37:25.536 --> 37:26.376
I'm warmed up.

37:26.376 --> 37:27.416
I don't need to squat.

37:27.416 --> 37:28.496
I can begin shooting now.

37:28.496 --> 37:29.856
Let's shoot.

37:30.616 --> 37:33.676
When you sneaked out yesterday,

37:33.696 --> 37:35.056
your family was worried sick.

37:35.056 --> 37:37.216
Are you trying to escape punishment?

37:37.776 --> 37:39.376
You should be on my side.

37:39.376 --> 37:41.536
You're my man.

37:42.176 --> 37:44.696
Fine. As your man,

37:44.696 --> 37:46.016
I have to

37:46.016 --> 37:47.436
be responsible for you.

37:48.256 --> 37:49.376
I'll have Miss Si watch you.

37:49.376 --> 37:50.596
No, wait!

37:50.616 --> 37:52.536
I'm squatting. Look.

37:58.616 --> 38:00.696
- Calm down. Don't be mad.
- You...

38:01.696 --> 38:04.016
That was for your sister.

38:10.376 --> 38:11.776
Mr. Zhen.

38:12.816 --> 38:15.036
Are you bringing Miss Si flowers again?

38:15.056 --> 38:17.096
I think she and Young Master Zhan

38:17.096 --> 38:19.176
went to the turf in the western suburbs.

38:21.016 --> 38:22.376
Thanks.

38:28.256 --> 38:29.096
My Lady,

38:29.096 --> 38:30.016
just now, Mr. Zhen

38:30.016 --> 38:32.016
came to bring Miss Si flowers again.

38:33.736 --> 38:35.376
What did he bring this time?

38:35.376 --> 38:36.556
Gardenias.

38:36.576 --> 38:38.696
Last time, it was Lan-tsao.

38:38.696 --> 38:41.296
Just now, he brought gardenias.

38:42.456 --> 38:44.296
How sweet.

38:44.736 --> 38:46.196
Si is

38:46.216 --> 38:48.696
such a lucky girl.

38:48.976 --> 38:51.976
(Zhou)

39:02.416 --> 39:06.256
♪ Looking back, I recall our first encounter ♪

39:07.096 --> 39:08.896
Great marksmanship!

39:08.936 --> 39:10.076
Excellent!

39:10.096 --> 39:11.356
You shoot with great precision.

39:11.376 --> 39:12.856
Teach me now!

39:13.136 --> 39:16.206
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

39:16.796 --> 39:20.306
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

39:20.326 --> 39:23.946
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

39:23.966 --> 39:27.316
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

39:27.316 --> 39:30.596
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

39:30.616 --> 39:31.716
Miss,

39:31.736 --> 39:33.536
do you adore Mr. Yu so much

39:33.536 --> 39:35.536
that you can't take your eyes off him?

39:36.656 --> 39:38.576
What are you talking about, Aman?

39:39.376 --> 39:41.416
Your eyes are fixated on him.

39:42.776 --> 39:44.136
No.

39:45.376 --> 39:49.246
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

39:49.266 --> 39:52.866
♪ However long the road is ♪

39:54.456 --> 39:57.096
Great! Brilliant!

39:57.616 --> 39:59.696
It hasn't been an hour. Squat.

40:00.936 --> 40:02.296
Chest out.

40:04.256 --> 40:07.216
Chin up, chest out, and breeze.

40:10.456 --> 40:11.816
Mr. Zhen.

40:12.576 --> 40:15.216
You're practicing hard, Young Master Zhan.

40:15.496 --> 40:17.096
It's nothing at all.

40:25.176 --> 40:26.576
Mr. Zhen.

40:28.376 --> 40:29.736
Miss Si.

40:31.056 --> 40:31.936
Miss,

40:31.936 --> 40:34.416
I'm going to boil some water.

40:37.576 --> 40:40.016
The gardenias are beautiful.

40:40.416 --> 40:42.596
A friend of mine,

40:42.616 --> 40:44.076
who was into gardening,

40:44.096 --> 40:45.496
planted them.

40:46.136 --> 40:47.696
Such flowers smell nice.

40:47.696 --> 40:49.196
They're simple and pleasant.

40:49.216 --> 40:51.296
I think they're perfect for you.

40:54.376 --> 40:56.016
Thank you,

40:56.416 --> 40:59.196
but I can't take them.

40:59.216 --> 41:00.576
Hold it.

41:03.136 --> 41:05.416
Don't feel pressured.

41:05.616 --> 41:07.656
They're nothing expensive.

41:07.776 --> 41:09.616
It's not about money.

41:10.216 --> 41:11.576
You see,

41:11.816 --> 41:13.556
you're a gentleman.

41:13.576 --> 41:16.416
You're pure and unworldly.

41:17.136 --> 41:18.576
However,

41:19.536 --> 41:21.616
I'm not as good as you think.

41:23.216 --> 41:25.136
I don't deserve your appreciation.

41:25.416 --> 41:26.776
You should

41:28.096 --> 41:29.496
be with a better girl.

41:37.736 --> 41:39.636
Did I do anything wrong

41:39.656 --> 41:41.376
that annoyed you?

41:43.896 --> 41:46.856
Tell me. I'll change.

41:47.256 --> 41:49.076
No, Zhen.

41:49.096 --> 41:50.576
You're a good man.

41:50.616 --> 41:52.496
It's my fault.

41:52.616 --> 41:54.496
I disappoint

41:55.536 --> 41:57.496
Mrs. Zhen and you.

42:06.056 --> 42:07.076
Miss Si,

42:07.096 --> 42:08.756
don't worry.

42:08.776 --> 42:11.656
I won't force you to do anything.

42:11.896 --> 42:13.096
I'll explain it to my mother.

42:13.096 --> 42:14.516
Once you accept me,

42:14.536 --> 42:16.056
I'll propose to you.

42:16.376 --> 42:18.096
As for the flowers,

42:20.896 --> 42:22.296
I'll bring them back

42:22.536 --> 42:23.916
and tend them well.

42:23.936 --> 42:25.776
If one day, you'd like to keep them,

42:25.796 --> 42:27.366
I'll bring them over again.

42:28.936 --> 42:30.296
Good day.

42:49.056 --> 42:49.936
Mr. Yu.

42:49.936 --> 42:54.096
(The End of Episode 12)

42:54.626 --> 42:56.356
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.356 --> 43:01.296
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.666 --> 43:04.046
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.046 --> 43:08.276
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.986 --> 43:11.386
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.406 --> 43:15.066
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.086 --> 43:18.506
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.656 --> 43:24.176
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.996 --> 43:28.676
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.676 --> 43:32.756
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.996 --> 43:34.736
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.756 --> 43:39.456
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.456 --> 43:43.026
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.046 --> 43:47.276
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.296 --> 43:49.076
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.076 --> 43:53.616
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.636 --> 43:58.436
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.666 --> 44:05.196
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.216 --> 44:08.836
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.856 --> 44:12.286
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.306 --> 44:16.926
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.926 --> 44:20.616
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.636 --> 44:24.726
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.836 --> 44:26.656
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.656 --> 44:31.206
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.226 --> 44:34.926
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.946 --> 44:39.106
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.286 --> 44:41.046
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.046 --> 44:45.566
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.566 --> 44:49.206
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.226 --> 44:54.896
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.586 --> 44:58.516
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.516 --> 45:06.016
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
